00:35:51,724 --> 00:35:57,724
The Lego Batman Movie is a 2017 animated superhero comedy film, based on
characters created by DC Comics and the Lego Batman toy line.

11
00:39:26,896 --> 00:39:32,896
It was directed by Chris McKay from a screenplay that
is based on a Seth Grahame-Smith story.

12
00:43:02,068 --> 00:43:08,068
The film is a collaboration between production houses from the United States, Australia, and Denmark,
the first spin-off in The Lego Movie franchise and the second installment overall.

13
00:46:37,241 --> 00:46:43,241
The film features Will Arnett reprising his role as Batman from The Lego Movie
alongside Zach Galifianakis, Michael Cera, Rosario Dawson and Ralph Fiennes.

14
00:50:12,413 --> 00:50:18,413
The story follows Batman as he attempts to overcome his greatest fear
while saving Gotham City from the Joker's latest scheme.

15
