announced several Lego films, following the critical and
commercial success of The Lego Movie.

17
01:00:57,931 --> 01:01:03,931
Chris McKay was hired to direct after being replaced by Rob Schrab as director of the
sequel to The Lego Movie, who then cited both The Naked Gun and the Airplane!

